BW is an inspirational people leader and founder of BW Success.

'''International People Developer''' 
BW has successfully trained business leaders and people all over the world. Working with both individuals and organisations to achieve great change, he has professionally trained people in Great Britain, Japan, Australia, France, Germany, & Cuba. 
BW is extremely committed to ensuring that everyone has the opportunity to develop themselves and will be completing an international tour to allow people in all countries to benefit from this life changing work.

'''People Leader'''
The nature of BW’s background in Human Resources enables him to really make a difference in any context. With a Masters in HR management and being a Chartered member of the professional institute, BW consistently uses this knowledge and skill to take organisations and their people to the next level. 

'''Organisational Innovator in Behavioural Psychology''' 
As a recognised catalyst for changing people’s lives, BW has a gift of being able to develop the potential of the people he meets in the training room or in general life. He has immersed himself in Behavioural Psychology over the last 10 years, studying strategies and skills which consistently allow people to achieve their true potential. The BW Success School has been a work of passion and the results for organisations to date have been astounding. 

'''Motivational Speaker'''
Inspirational, thought-provoking, life-changing are just a few words which have been associated with BW. His approach is refreshing, humorous, challenging, and extremely engaging on many different levels. He is the message. BW has given speeches and presentations in many different scenarios around the world. 

'''Life Coach'''
Not a teacher, not a lecturer, not a trainer. A Guide. Sometimes leading from the front, sometimes walking with you, sometimes watching your progress. Bringing his knowledge, skill and coaching ability to the fore, BW has guided hundreds of people towards the ultimate goal of realising their true potential. His unique style makes a huge difference in people’s lives, and supports them in finding a true measure of health, wealth, and happiness. 

'''Community Champion'''
You can determine a lot from the values of a person and of an organisation. BW is fully committed to making the world a better place for everyone. BW is a regular volunteer and often gives up his time for free to help local people and communities. On a larger scale every year BW and his team run several BW Success School’s for free to support and make a difference for charitable organisations, community groups, and not-for-profit organisations around the world. 

'''Author'''
Being the founder of the BW Success School, BW is in the process of publishing a book based on the BW Success System. The book will bring together for the first time BW'S amazing experiences in changing lives and present them in his own unique way to the benefit of many, many people.